  "failure_modes": {"postgres": ["DEP-DOWN", "DEP-SLOW", "RECOVERY"], "redis": ["SOFT-DEP"]},
  "contract_violations": [],
  "bugs_found": []
}
```

The report `integration_tests.md` lists: rows covered (by TC ID), contract violations, bugs found, and
any abuse or failure row marked not applicable, with the reason.

